This product includes logic and test vectors derived from the following
open-source projects:

1. promptparse
   https://github.com/maythiwat/promptparse
   MIT License, Copyright (c) Maythiwat Chomchuen
   Used for PromptPay/EMVCo TLV behaviour and slip Mini QR test vectors.

2. promptparse-jvm
   https://github.com/sunJirapath/promptparse-jvm
   Apache License 2.0
   Used as the specification reference for standard/TrueMoney slip Mini QR
   parsing and CRC handling (see docs/SPEC_NOTES.md in that project).

3. thai-qr-payment
   https://github.com/uunw/thai-qr-payment
   MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 uunw
   Used for cross-checking standard and TrueMoney slip vectors.

The implementation in src/lib/slip-payload.ts is a focused TypeScript port of
the publicly documented Mini QR format. It performs a structural pre-check
only. It does not confirm that a transfer exists at a bank, and it is not
affiliated with the Bank of Thailand or any bank.
